Establishment of vigil mechanism  

269. Company shall establish a vigil mechanism for their Directors and employees to report their genuine concerns or 
grievances. The audit Committee shall oversee the vigil mechanism. The vigil mechanism shall provide for adequate 
safeguards against victimisation of employees and Directors who avail of the vigil mechanism and also provide for direct 
access to the Chairperson of the audit Committee or the Director nominated to play the role of audit Committee, as the 
case may be, in exceptional cases. In case of repeated frivolous complaints being filed by a Director or an employee, the 
audit Committee may take suitable action against the concerned Director or employee including reprimand.
